                    "Know your rights under Good Cause Eviction and, if facing eviction, contact Right to Counsel NYC Coalition or Housing Court Answers for same-day help finding a Right to Counsel-eligible attorney -- and know that citywide representation has fallen to roughly 30%, so asking for an adjournment to secure counsel matters.",
