                    "Apply early for the NY State HEAP Cooling Assistance Benefit via ACCESS NYC or OTDA each spring — funds are first-come-first-served and the 2026 benefit closed on 5 June, so late applicants are shut out for the whole summer. Note you are ineligible if your household received a HEAP-funded AC within the past five years.",
                    "During a heat emergency, use NYC Emergency Management's Cooling Center Finder or call 311 to locate the nearest cooling center (library, community or senior center, or NYCHA facility) under the Local Law 85/128 network.",
